+++
+++- Section locators: `htmlSectionLocator.ts` (`allocateSectionLocatorId`, `sectionSlugFromHeading`).
+++- Inline hash/truncate: `passageInlineText.ts` (`buildInlinePassageTextRef`, `MAX_INLINE_PASSAGE_CODE_POINTS`).
